Z||000005||Patrick's Dad||12-09-2001||09:38 PM||||I heard it similarly (with differing characters), up to the actual wishes. The characters were two engineers and a manager, then, at work, someone typed in two of the employee's names and the boss's name. Something like this:<P>Two employees were out walking with their boss when they came across a lamp that contained a genie. The genie offered them a wish apiece, for a total of three wishes.<P>The first employee said: "I want to be a millionaire, and live in a beautiful house with a beautiful woman." POOF! He was gone.<P>The scond employee said: "I want to be a billionaire, and live in a huge, beautiful house on an island with a hundred beautiful women." POOF! He, too, disappeared.<P>The genie looked at the boss. "And you? What is your wish?"<P>The boss looked at the genie and said, "I want them back at their desks in five minutes."||||reg||1
